# Real documents must never enter the repo (only synthetic samples under data/samples/)
_docs/
real_docs/
private/
_private/
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
*.pptx
!data/samples/**/*.pdf
!data/samples/**/*.docx
!data/samples/**/*.doc
!data/samples/**/*.xlsx
